---
/**
 * Case Study Component
 */
---

<article class="case-study rounded-xl shadow bg-white overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-0 md:gap-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
  <div class="case-study__image flex-shrink-0 w-full md:w-2/5">
    <img 
      src="/images/case-study-placeholder.jpg" 
      alt="Screenshot or mockup of the case study project" 
      class="object-cover w-full h-64 md:h-full"
      loading="lazy"
    >
  </div>
  <div class="case-study__content p-6 flex flex-col justify-center w-full">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-semibold text-taupe-950 mb-2">
      Product Redesign: Acme App
    </h2>
    <p class="text-taupe-700 text-base mb-0">
      Led the redesign of Acme’s flagship SaaS product for a smoother onboarding, enhanced usability, and a more cohesive multi-platform experience. Collaborated with engineering and marketing to ship improvements that increased user retention by 24%.
    </p>
  </div>
</article>

<style>
  .case-study__image img {
    border-radius: 0;
    /* You can also add aspect-ratio or object-fit if wanted */
  }
</style>